WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:08.150
Gold Roger, the legendary King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

3
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.890
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

4
00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:17.430
You want my treasure? Go ahead. Find it!

5
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.830
Everything is right where I left it!

6
00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.840
Pirates have set out in pursuit of their dreams!

7
00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.440
The world has truly entered... the Great Pirate Era!

8
00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:29.380
Gotta keep movin’, just can't stop

9
00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:33.780
Rarin’ for the dawn to arrive

10
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:37.480
One, two, sunshine, four, we go!

11
00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:43.290
Hoist the flag for the break of romance dawn

12
00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:49.500
Jump-start your day, ready to make waves

13
00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:54.200
Reachin’ for fantastic realms

14
00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:58.370
Need to put your toughness on display

15
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:01.680
Is bein’ brazen such a crime?

16
00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:04.480
If you’re wanted, you’re a winner

17
00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:09.620
Ah, freedom is our only rule

18
00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:15.660
Worries don’t bother us at all

19
00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:18.430
Keep on goin’, that's our pledge

20
00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:22.030
Since the day our dreams began

21
00:01:22.460 --> 00:01:26.870
Our aims remain the same

22
00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.240
Sunlight won’t fade from our hearts

23
00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:33.670
The sun of my heart will never set

24
00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:40.450
One, two, sunshine... One, two, sunshine

25
00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:47.850
One, two, sunshine, four, we go!

26
00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.930
We go!

27
00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:59.840
<b>10,000 Meters Under the Sea</b>

28
00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:56.270
The undersea volcano's gonna erupt!

29
00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:59.200
We are too close to it!

30
00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.510
Everyone!

31
00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:04.710
Let's go back for now!

32
00:02:05.340 --> 00:02:08.680
Roger! Captain Vander Decken!

33
00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.720
Ankoro! Wadatsumi! Draw the ship!

34
00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:13.120
Oh, okay!

35
00:02:13.850 --> 00:02:18.020
I am the richest person in the world - Captain Vander Decken!

36
00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.130
Oh no!

37
00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:25.660
Luffy, tell Kraken to get away from here now!

38
00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:26.660
Yeah!

39
00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.000
Hey, Surume!

40
00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.170
Wait, don't need to!

41
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.910
He's running like hell already!

42
00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:37.440
That's a terrible look for such a mythical monster!

43
00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.780
Nice! Maybe we can hit it off!

44
00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:44.210
He runs awful.

45
00:02:44.210 --> 00:02:46.020
Don't say that.

46
00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:48.790
That's how horrifying the eruption is!

47
00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.790
That's right!

48
00:02:50.790 --> 00:02:52.890
And what is he doing?

49
00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:56.360
Wow! Yes! Come on!

50
00:02:56.360 --> 00:02:57.560
It's rehab!

51
00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:02.530
But I wanna see the eruption!

52
00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.870
Evacuate to the front of the ship!

53
00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:05.940
Yeah!

54
00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:09.210
It doesn't change anything! It's only a few meters.

55
00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.030
Lava's flowing along to the sea floor!

56
00:03:29.530 --> 00:03:31.460
The temperature is soaring!

57
00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:34.900
Feels like I'm in boiling water!

58
00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:36.370
Hot! Hot!

59
00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.370
I'm gonna be cooked!

60
00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.850
The ghost ship and the sea bonze!

61
00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.350
Run, Surume!

62
00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:56.020
You can do it!

63
00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:58.420
Go faster, Surume!

64
00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.290
Or you're gonna become boiled octopus!

65
00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:07.430
Boiled octopus? That's great! I wanna eat some!

66
00:04:10.170 --> 00:04:13.540
Because of the difference in temperature, the sea current's starting to swirl!

67
00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:15.010
Nami,

68
00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:18.480
which way is Fishman Island–

69
00:04:19.210 --> 00:04:21.040
Even at a time like this?

70
00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:23.080
Sanji, you have to focus on your rehab!

71
00:04:23.550 --> 00:04:25.950
Keep going straight!

72
00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.120
We're getting close!

73
00:04:32.860 --> 00:04:34.530
Jump into that trench!

74
00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:41.970
What?!

75
00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:44.170
In there?!

76
00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.810
It's a sheer cliff! You've got to be kidding!

77
00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.980
It's darker than dark!

78
00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:55.650
Are you sure that Fishman Island is in there?!

79
00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:04.050
It's hot in the back!

80
00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:06.760
It's totally dark in the front! Scary!

81
00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.490
I'm sure there'll be another monster!

82
00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.030
I don't think we can make it home alive!

83
00:05:12.030 --> 00:05:13.700
Luffy!

84
00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:17.800
The darkness is a bottomless pot that connects to hell!

85
00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:18.870
Iron pot!

86
00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.240
Tea caddy! Tea-tea caddy!

87
00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:24.580
Jump in, Surume!

88
00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:32.720
It's erupting again!

89
00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:36.850
What is that?!

90
00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.460
Right above us!

91
00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:40.160
Rocks?!

92
00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:41.120
Mud?!

93
00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:43.060
It's an avalanche of rocks and earth!

94
00:05:43.060 --> 00:05:45.530
The eruption caused it!

95
00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.860
Get away, Surume!

96
00:05:51.070 --> 00:05:52.900
I'm gonna go out and cut them!

97
00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:55.870
Luffy! Hold on tightly to my leg!

98
00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:57.740
Okay, I got it!

99
00:05:58.110 --> 00:05:59.480
Zoro, no!

100
00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:01.910
Hey, let me go!

101
00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:04.510
We're 8,000 meters deep now!

102
00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:07.950
If you go out, you'll be crushed by the water pressure!

103
00:06:07.950 --> 00:06:09.990
Then what should we do?!

104
00:06:09.990 --> 00:06:11.960
Leave it to me!

105
00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:14.260
Lethal Green Star...

106
00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.990
Sargasso!

107
00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:23.600
The sea plant popped out!

108
00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:25.840
That's so cool, Usopp!

109
00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:28.210
It only holds for a while.

110
00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:31.240
Now is the chance to get away, Surume!

111
00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:41.120
Just in time!

112
00:06:46.460 --> 00:06:49.460
Usopp, that was great!

113
00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:52.830
Yes, it was great judgment!

114
00:06:51.190 --> 00:06:52.830
Piece of cake!

115
00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.130
We made it through!

116
00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:59.140
Surume, you did great too!

117
00:06:59.140 --> 00:07:00.600
We're safe now!

118
00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.110
Thank you, Surume!

119
00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:04.210
– Surume! Hey!
– Surume!

120
00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:06.180
– Surume!
– Surume! Hey!

121
00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:08.110
– Surume! Come on!
– Surume!

122
00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.850
– Surume!
– Surume! Hey!

123
00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:10.350
– Su–
– Su–

124
00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:35.870
<b>10,000 Meters Below Sea Level
The Deep (The Bottom of the Oceanic Trench)</b>

125
00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.740
I... I'm alive!

126
00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.510
Light?

127
00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:42.550
This deep in the sea?

128
00:07:42.550 --> 00:07:45.450
It's too bright! My eyes are dazzled!

129
00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:48.750
But I don't have eyes to be dazzled.

130
00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:52.420
Hey guys, come here!

131
00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:54.730
Look at that!

132
00:07:55.590 --> 00:07:57.730
I can't see it–it's too bright.

133
00:07:57.730 --> 00:07:59.430
Hey Nami, is that it?

134
00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:02.070
Yeah, there's no doubt.

135
00:08:02.070 --> 00:08:04.330
The needle is pointing at the island!

136
00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.440
That is...

137
00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:09.310
Fishman Island!

138
00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:11.410
It's huge!

139
00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:14.440
It's in a big bubble!

140
00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:16.150
There are clouds?

141
00:08:16.150 --> 00:08:18.150
Maybe there is air inside.

142
00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:24.020
Yeah!

143
00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.620
We made it!

144
00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:29.290
It's a popular site in the Grand Line!

145
00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.100
They made it there!

146
00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.000
The mermaids dance around here.

147
00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.800
The beautiful mermaids!

148
00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.170
I'm finally here!

149
00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:46.480
Hooray! Hooray! Hooray! Hooray!

150
00:08:40.770 --> 00:08:46.480
Super! Super! Super! Super! Super! Super!

151
00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:46.480
The paradise that I've been dreaming of since I was a kid!

152
00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:53.020
– Mermaido! Mermaido!
– Mermaido! Mermaido!

153
00:08:53.020 --> 00:08:55.050
– Mermaido!
– Mermai–

154
00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:58.660
Sanji! You're not ready! You shouldn't even think about it!

155
00:08:58.660 --> 00:08:59.520
Sanji!

156
00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:10.830
I'm sorry, Sanji!

157
00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.900
The rehab didn't work yet!

158
00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.140
You shouldn't look at real mermaids.

159
00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:17.640
Doctor!

160
00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:22.010
It was his dream to see the mermaids on Fishman Island!

161
00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:24.510
But he's gonna die if he sees them!

162
00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:25.480
No!

163
00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:29.090
I don't care...

164
00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:29.890
Sanji!

165
00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:33.720
Rather than live longer without a dream...

166
00:09:34.620 --> 00:09:38.360
I wanna die staring at the mermaids in a disgusting way!

167
00:09:38.860 --> 00:09:39.800
You're scum!

168
00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:44.840
I'm gonna look at the mrmaids!

169
00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:45.700
He's burning!

170
00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.040
The flame of his eroticism!

171
00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:50.140
I can't wait!

172
00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:53.980
I wonder what kind of meat is in their dishes!

173
00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:56.280
Luffy, wipe your drool.

174
00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:58.280
Can you give an order to Surume?

175
00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.650
Let's look for the entrance.

176
00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.350
Hey, what are they?!

177
00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:08.290
Why are you obeying such fools as humans,

178
00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.230
Kraken!

179
00:10:12.000 --> 00:10:14.000
Who are they?

180
00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:16.900
The group of sea monsters!

181
00:10:18.400 --> 00:10:21.570
We're dead! After we got all the way here!

182
00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:26.540
They're so cool! The sea monsters!

183
00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:30.580
Somebody's riding it!

184
00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.520
What are you doing, Surume?!

185
00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:41.020
We were almost there!

186
00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:58.170
W-We're right in middle of the sea monsters!

187
00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.410
You guys are the Straw Hats, aren't you?

188
00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:06.280
I know you all very well.

189
00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:11.760
You are the ones who foiled the plans of the Arlong Pirates.

190
00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:16.860
That act was easy enough to understand.

191
00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:22.770
But then you stood up for Hachi, the former officer of the Arlong Pirates two years ago...

192
00:11:23.630 --> 00:11:27.600
and knocked one of the hateful Celestial Dragons out!

193
00:11:29.110 --> 00:11:35.310
Just like Fisher Tiger, the hero of Fishman Island who we respect.

194
00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:37.810
Fisher... Tiger...

195
00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:42.790
<b>Fighter Hammond
New Fishman Pirates</b>

196
00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.790
It's hard to decide what I should do with you.

197
00:11:42.790 --> 00:11:45.660
So, tell me.

198
00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:48.530
<b>Assassin Hyozo
New Fishman Pirates</b>

199
00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:48.530
Are you guys our enemies or not?

200
00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:54.830
<b>Fighter Kasagon
New Fishman Pirates</b>

201
00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.660
I give you an option.

202
00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.970
Do you wanna enlist under our banner – the New Fishman Pirates?

203
00:11:56.670 --> 00:11:58.500
Or do you refuse?

204
00:11:59.140 --> 00:12:01.370
If you refuse, we'll sink you.

205
00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:02.670
What did you say?

206
00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:05.710
Franky, fuel up!

207
00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:07.310
Huh? What are you gonna do?

208
00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:11.280
You know that Luffy and the others won't give in to them.

209
00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:15.490
But we're 10,000 meters deep now.

210
00:12:15.490 --> 00:12:18.990
We can't even fight and there's no chance to win.

211
00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:20.520
So we run!

212
00:12:21.090 --> 00:12:26.030
Do the Coup de Burst using all the air we have and charge into Fishman Island!

213
00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:28.800
Are you serious?

214
00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.400
Otherwise, we are all gonna die after coming this far.

215
00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:37.840
It seems like that's the only way that we can survive.

216
00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:40.610
Okay, I'll fill it up.

217
00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.380
Franky, steer the ship!

218
00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:45.680
Alright, super count on me!

219
00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:52.120
So, do you wanna work under us, Straw Hat Luffy?

220
00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.160
No way!

221
00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.630
Stupid!

222
00:12:59.860 --> 00:13:01.630
You refused...

223
00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:05.540
the offer to join the New Fishman Pirates!

224
00:13:05.940 --> 00:13:08.510
Then you guys are the fishmen's enemy!

225
00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.040
Just sinful human beings!

226
00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:17.410
Why should we work under you?!

227
00:13:17.410 --> 00:13:20.050
Luffy, don't rub them the wrong way!

228
00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:22.250
It's a shame.

229
00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:25.190
Then we can't let you pass through here.

230
00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:28.160
This is where we sink you!

231
00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:30.430
Sea lion!

232
00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:36.700
It's done!

233
00:13:36.700 --> 00:13:38.330
Franky, do it!

234
00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:40.770
Sink it!

235
00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:42.340
Wanna fight?!

236
00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:46.810
Go, Franky!

237
00:13:47.140 --> 00:13:49.110
The Sunny is a lion too!

238
00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:53.250
Let's fight someday, sea lion!

239
00:13:53.620 --> 00:13:55.090
Here we go!

240
00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:58.050
Coup de Burst!

241
00:14:03.260 --> 00:14:04.230
The ship is...!

242
00:14:13.670 --> 00:14:15.970
We're losing air...

243
00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:19.340
We're gonna get crushed...

244
00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.650
I can't breathe!

245
00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.250
But I don't have lungs.

246
00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:29.420
Endure it! Until we reach Fishman Island!

247
00:14:32.160 --> 00:14:35.230
What's wrong with that ship?!

248
00:14:36.030 --> 00:14:38.230
We're heading in!

249
00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.730
Wait for me, my dear mermaids!

250
00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:51.570
The coating came off!

251
00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.280
It got stuck on the giant bubble!

252
00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:57.280
Look ahead!

253
00:14:58.110 --> 00:14:59.680
What is that?!

254
00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:03.850
The bubble here is a double structure!

255
00:15:04.150 --> 00:15:07.360
Normal ships will fall in this layer because there is only air!

256
00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:10.660
We're gonna run into one more bubble!

257
00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.130
Hold on tight!

258
00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.470
Water?!

259
00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:36.050
The current is strong!

260
00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:42.760
Help... me...

261
00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.490
Can't breathe...

262
00:15:46.560 --> 00:15:49.270
We have four devil fruit eaters but...

263
00:15:58.440 --> 00:15:59.640
Reach...

264
00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.210
...out!

265
00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:06.680
Nami!

266
00:16:06.680 --> 00:16:08.320
Robin!

267
00:16:10.520 --> 00:16:11.790
Damn!

268
00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:14.320
I can't swim against the current!

269
00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:32.380
That's a crazy way to get in there. Maybe they tried to self-destruct.

270
00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.780
Do you wanna go after them, Hammond?

271
00:16:35.780 --> 00:16:38.410
I don't know if they're still alive though.

272
00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:42.290
Yeah, we'll go in.

273
00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:45.720
I don't want Neptune's army to find them first.

274
00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:50.490
But first, let's go back to Noah and let Boss know that...

275
00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:55.000
Straw Hat who shattered Arlong's ambition is here.

276
00:16:59.040 --> 00:17:04.240
<b>Fishman Island, on the Seafloor</b>

277
00:17:06.340 --> 00:17:07.110
Hey.

278
00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:11.710
Hey, look.

279
00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:12.580
I'll look.

280
00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.650
I won't!

281
00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:14.880
Maybe I'll look.

282
00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.150
I looked, so what?

283
00:17:18.860 --> 00:17:20.220
Hey, he's moving!

284
00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:21.220
He moved!

285
00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.730
He didn't!

286
00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:24.630
Maybe he moved.

287
00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:25.960
He moved, so what?

288
00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:32.670
Yeah, he woke up!

289
00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:34.640
Luffy!

290
00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.470
Luffy-chin!

291
00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:42.210
I'm glad that you're okay!

292
00:17:42.210 --> 00:17:44.110
How are you?

293
00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:50.850
Camie! It's been a while!

294
00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:55.460
You've gotten prettier, Camie!

295
00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:58.290
We landed on the Fishman Island?!

296
00:17:58.290 --> 00:17:59.600
Yeah, we did!

297
00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:03.970
I've been told that we were drowning but some Mermaids rescued us!

298
00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:04.970
That's right.

299
00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:09.110
As a matter of fact, we just woke up a couple minutes ago too.

300
00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:11.410
This is Camie's house.

301
00:18:11.410 --> 00:18:12.380
Here's your hat.

302
00:18:12.380 --> 00:18:14.940
Oh, this is Camie's house.

303
00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.350
I'm sorry!

304
00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:21.950
I was gonna pick you guys up but I thought it was a month later.

305
00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.450
Don't worry!

306
00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:24.520
Where are the others?

307
00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:26.960
Well...

308
00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.360
It looks like we got separated.

309
00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:32.630
I wonder if they're okay.

310
00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:33.860
Is that so?

311
00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:39.640
Yeah, I was following them up to some point but they were taken somewhere else.

312
00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:43.140
Well, I'm sure they'll be fine!

313
00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:44.570
I think so.

314
00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:47.080
The bone can't do much in the sea...

315
00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:50.580
but they got the robot and the green one so they'll be fine!

316
00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:53.520
I wanna see the others too.

317
00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.080
Oh, here!

318
00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:57.150
I know you're all freezing.

319
00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.390
I made soup so have some and get warm.

320
00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.520
Ta-dah!

321
00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:03.360
Cold seaweed soup!

322
00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:04.460
You'll love it!

323
00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:10.500
Cold soup?

324
00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.330
Uh-huh!

325
00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:17.810
You can't get warm with cold soup!

326
00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:19.340
What should I do?!

327
00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:20.740
What?!

328
00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:23.080
I made a mistake!

329
00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:28.790
Don't worry, Camie!

330
00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:31.720
It warms me up anyway!

331
00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:33.560
How is that possible?

332
00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:35.360
Hey, Sanji! I want some too!

333
00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:39.860
Your clothes are dry!

334
00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:40.730
They are dry.

335
00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:42.370
They aren't dry!

336
00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:43.870
Maybe they are dry.

337
00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.130
They are dry, so what?

338
00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:52.780
You dried our clothes!

339
00:19:52.780 --> 00:19:53.880
Thanks!

340
00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:54.580
Thank you!

341
00:19:55.140 --> 00:19:57.410
By the way, who are you guys?

342
00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:59.350
Oh, they're my friends.

343
00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:01.320
The Medaka Mermaid Quintuplets.

344
00:20:01.320 --> 00:20:02.450
I'm Oneka!

345
00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:03.320
I'm Twoka!

346
00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:04.320
I'm Threeka!

347
00:20:04.320 --> 00:20:05.220
I'm Fourka!

348
00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:06.720
I'm Fourka Two!

349
00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.560
Why can't it be Fiveka?

350
00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.730
They swim fast and they're pretty savvy.

351
00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.930
Oh, really?

352
00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:16.830
We're at the sea floor of the Mermaid Cove.

353
00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:21.100
And this is the girls' dorm for the Mermaid Cafe so I have a lot of friends here!

354
00:20:21.100 --> 00:20:22.170
What?

355
00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:23.710
Girls' dorm?!

356
00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.140
Camie!

357
00:20:25.140 --> 00:20:28.880
What... What... What is Mermaid Cafe?

358
00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:32.120
It's a cafe where I'm working as a waitress.

359
00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.120
There are a lot of beautiful mermaids!

360
00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:36.250
B-Beautiful mermaids?!

361
00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:41.160
Do you want a cup of coffee? Or...

362
00:20:44.060 --> 00:20:46.960
– Sanji is...
– ...in danger!

363
00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:48.800
Dammit!

364
00:20:48.800 --> 00:20:49.770
– He endured!
– He endured!

365
00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:51.470
I...

366
00:20:53.200 --> 00:20:57.870
I swore that I'd never have a nosebleed and pass out...

367
00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:00.440
on Fishman Island!

368
00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:08.620
So I should be rewarded by now, shouldn't I...?

369
00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:10.150
How desperate...

370
00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:11.450
Oh yeah!

371
00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:13.590
Let's go up!

372
00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:15.530
I want you to meet my friends.

373
00:21:18.430 --> 00:21:20.400
Oh, it's a turtle!

374
00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.270
It says "Sea Turtle Elevator."

375
00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.940
Turtle-chin, take us up.

376
00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:35.140
This is a coral apartment in the sea.

377
00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:38.110
The dorm is at the very bottom so the rent is cheap.

378
00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:41.650
The top floor gets natural light so it's the most expensive.

379
00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:44.550
Are you poor?

380
00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:46.460
By the way, where are Hachi and Pappagu?

381
00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:49.330
Ha-chin got severely injured about a year ago.

382
00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:54.130
He tried to protect the Sunny at Sabaody.

383
00:21:54.130 --> 00:21:57.770
I heard that he's pretty much recovered now...

384
00:21:57.770 --> 00:22:01.770
but Ha-chin is originally from the Fishman District so he's resting there.

385
00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.010
Fishman District?

386
00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:04.940
Yeah...

387
00:22:04.940 --> 00:22:10.450
It's kind of a rough area but I can take you there since I feel safe with you guys.

388
00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:11.610
Let's go later!

389
00:22:11.610 --> 00:22:13.780
I have to thank him face to face.

390
00:22:13.780 --> 00:22:15.590
Okay, I got it!

391
00:22:15.590 --> 00:22:18.320
And Pappagu is...

392
00:22:19.460 --> 00:22:22.330
He's a very famous designer,

393
00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:27.530
so he has a big mansion in Fishverly Hills, the high-class district.

394
00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:31.030
I'm gonna deliver clams there today so come with me!

395
00:22:31.370 --> 00:22:32.870
He's your pet, right?

396
00:22:33.570 --> 00:22:35.200
Why don't you live with him?

397
00:22:36.440 --> 00:22:39.540
That area is way beyond my means.

398
00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:42.880
We have better clams here, anyway.

399
00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:44.850
We're almost there!

400
00:22:46.050 --> 00:22:48.780
Hey, that's that straw-like thing?

401
00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:49.990
Oh, that's...

402
00:22:50.350 --> 00:22:54.060
the water road that a bubble craftsman made.

403
00:22:54.060 --> 00:22:57.030
We and the fish get in and...

404
00:22:57.590 --> 00:22:59.460
Here, watch.

405
00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:08.270
We're here, on the surface!

406
00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:10.670
Luffy-chin!

407
00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:13.540
See?

408
00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:15.880
I can even swim in the sky!

409
00:23:15.880 --> 00:23:17.880
Oh, looks fun!

410
00:23:19.080 --> 00:23:20.480
Wait a minute!

411
00:23:20.480 --> 00:23:23.920
Besides that, there's a sky and clouds in the deep sea!

412
00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:26.090
Hey, Camie!

413
00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:27.960
Huh? It's a girl's voice!

414
00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:30.590
Everybody!

415
00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:34.800
Are your friends fine now?

416
00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:36.570
The pirates who were drowning.

417
00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:42.670
You guys didn't come in by the entrance.

418
00:23:45.210 --> 00:23:46.440
Hello!

419
00:23:46.440 --> 00:23:48.440
You guys don't look that scary.

420
00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:49.950
You guys entered illegally?

421
00:23:49.950 --> 00:23:51.080
So wild!

422
00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:52.720
I love pirates!

423
00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:05.590
It's like a living fairy tale!

424
00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:09.530
A land of coral! The Mermaid Cove!

425
00:24:23.510 --> 00:24:24.380
Huh?!

426
00:24:24.380 --> 00:24:26.420
Sanji is crying!

427
00:24:26.850 --> 00:24:29.490
He's crying harder than when he left the Baratie.

428
00:24:32.390 --> 00:24:34.890
I found it!

429
00:24:35.260 --> 00:24:38.630
This is my All Blue!

430
00:24:40.860 --> 00:24:43.370
Is it really what you want, Sanji?

431
00:24:44.700 --> 00:24:46.540
Let me introduce them to you!

432
00:24:47.040 --> 00:24:49.540
He's the captain - Luffy-chin.

433
00:24:49.540 --> 00:24:50.740
Yeah, good to see you!

434
00:24:51.370 --> 00:24:53.210
The crying one is Sanji-chin.

435
00:24:53.840 --> 00:24:55.140
The one with the nose - Usopp-chin.

436
00:24:55.710 --> 00:24:56.450
Nice to meet you!

437
00:24:56.950 --> 00:24:59.120
The racoon is Chopper-chin.

438
00:24:59.120 --> 00:25:00.220
I'm a reindeer!

439
00:25:01.150 --> 00:25:04.090
What's wrong? Why are you crying?

440
00:25:05.320 --> 00:25:06.690
Come with me!

441
00:25:06.690 --> 00:25:08.790
Let's dance in the water!

442
00:25:13.760 --> 00:25:16.400
Oh yeah, I get it now.

443
00:25:16.400 --> 00:25:19.000
This is too good to be true.

444
00:25:19.000 --> 00:25:21.800
I'm probably gonna die today!

445
00:25:21.800 --> 00:25:23.640
How negative!

446
00:25:23.640 --> 00:25:26.780
Seriously, what happened to you in the past two years?

447
00:25:26.780 --> 00:25:30.150
This is the paradise that you've been dreaming of!

448
00:25:31.350 --> 00:25:33.580
You're so funny, Sanji!

449
00:25:33.580 --> 00:25:35.720
– No, he's not trying to be funny!
– No, he's not trying to be funny!

450
00:25:43.830 --> 00:25:45.590
I see.

451
00:25:45.290 --> 00:25:50.530
<b>Noah, Fishman District</b>

452
00:25:45.590 --> 00:25:50.530
Straw Hat Luffy finally got this far.

453
00:25:51.600 --> 00:25:52.600
Yes.

454
00:25:52.600 --> 00:25:56.570
Wh-What should we do, Boss?

455
00:25:58.770 --> 00:26:00.410
Bring him...

456
00:26:01.780 --> 00:26:03.110
here!
